# Font build output and intermediates.
#
# The nine emmentaler-*.otf files that get SHIPPED are committed elsewhere in
# the repository, as CodeBrix.LilyPort assets. This directory's out/ holds a
# working build -- .pfb, .tfm, .log, .lisp, .svg intermediates and per-font
# logs -- and is regenerated by ./build-fonts.sh. Do not commit it.
out/

# Ad-hoc build transcripts.
*.build-log
*.gen-log
build-run.txt

__pycache__/
